            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for a pay rise, then the Marathi for to earn."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: पदोन्नती",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पदोन्नती — padonnatī — \"a promotion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीराला या वर्षी पदोन्नती मिळाली. mīrālā yā varṣī padonnatī miḷālī. Meera got a promotion this year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पदोन्नती (padonnatī) is a tatsama compound of Sanskrit pada, \"step, position\", and unnati, \"rising\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
