              "text": "झटणे — jhaṭṇe — \"to strive; to work hard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पदोन्नतीसाठी तो दिवसरात्र झटला. padonnatīsāṭhī to divasrātra jhaṭlā. He strove day and night for the promotion."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो झटला, to jhaṭlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The goal takes -साठी: यशासाठी झटणे (jhaṭṇe)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "झटणे (jhaṭṇe) is an expressive Marathi verb. CDIAL lists a Marathi jhaṭṇe, \"to collide violently\", under jhaṭ, \"sudden movement\" (CDIAL 5327), but not the sense \"to strive\", so the link is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
